# MANIFEST.sha256 -- shasum -a 256 of the files ps2r_recompiler_v2 + continuations.py GENERATE into
# ${PS2R_RECOMP_GEN_DIR} from SCUS_973.16 (a511a94b...6a73). Hashes of derived output, not game data;
# the files themselves are never committed. Recorded from the generation WITH --yield-backedges
# (the sched stage; the previous, flag-off generation's hashes are the ones the engine's Crash
# regeneration still reproduces -- see INVOCATION.md); cmake/ps2r_verify_manifest.cmake checks a
# regeneration against it.
# Re-recorded (pad_mc stage) after the generator gated the first title's address-keyed emission
# overrides behind --legacy-title-stubs (legacy_title_addr): recompiled.cpp, continuations.h and
# recompiled_shard_031.cpp changed; the 32 other shards are byte-identical to the previous manifest.
# Re-recorded (overlays stage, E210) after the discovery walk learned the kernel's no-return
# syscalls (rv2_decode.h is_noreturn_syscall_imm: `addiu v1,zero,{0x04,0x23,0x24}; syscall` is a
# hard stop): crt0's InitMainThread root 0x100220 no longer absorbs the address-taken function
# 0x100228 (a Splice native pointed to from .data 0x2ac8e0) -- 6575 functions (was 6574).
# Re-recorded 2026-10-22 (eecode round 4): generator change -- recomp_call's un-hooked check first, the JR/JALR sites
# cache the containing dense id (s_id_<pc>) and dispatch raw through it, the raw-path gate reads the engine seam
# recomp_fast_dispatch_enabled (engine.ee_fast_dispatch) instead of PS2_EE_RAWDISP. Every shard changed (the sites).
# Re-recorded 2026-10-24 (cane round 6): generator change -- every VU0 macro-mode FMAC op commits the MAC /
# STATUS flags (VuMacroCommitFlags, host_app/vu.h); every shard with COP2 arithmetic changed (the flag commits),
# recompiled.h / recompiled.cpp / 5 shards without macro ops byte-identical.
